{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/fa1a46cffb8966a2474d1230e1cffcd7.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/fa1a46cffb8966a2474d1230e1cffcd7.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/fa1a46cffb8966a2474d1230e1cffcd7.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>Lokko is currently in EARLY ACCESS. Several features are limited in functionality or not present and may not work as expected. <br>Join our Discord:  <br>All player inventory, content and unlocks may reset when game exits EARLY ACCESS. We hope to gather all user feedback to improve the game and release a polished version for Final Release. For in-game feedback: Press TrackPad on DualSense controller or and enter feedback in the form. <br>E-mail us: <a href=\"mailto:support@appymonkeys.com\">support@appymonkeys.com</a> <br>Discord: <strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>LOKKO</strong> is a unique 3D platformer where fun meets creativity. Create and share challenging levels across <strong>PS5\u00ae</strong>, <strong>PC</strong> and <strong>iOS</strong> seamlessly and in real time. Create your own avatar and design your own enemies and bosses Leverage the power of <strong>DualSense\u2122</strong> on all three platforms. Players can trade their creations and compete against each other. Be the one who makes the most fun, unique and creative level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/892bf6f493a68f4f3776783acc39349e.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2ab7ce2c3f8f08da30fb1d2745d1fa05.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/75d6b84a41b53e76589dccef8e535824.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/75d6b84a41b53e76589dccef8e535824.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/75d6b84a41b53e76589dccef8e535824.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our In-built level editor for platforming, players have the ability to generate and distribute their own levels. Hook up advanced level designs by chaining timers, accelerators and switches, placing NPCs and Bosses to make fun playable levels with your friends. Easy to use and intuitive controls with game controllers and keyboard/ mouse support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                              <strong>Character Editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/8e16b49c5ece8f9162c005fc04acd5c8.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/8e16b49c5ece8f9162c005fc04acd5c8.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/8e16b49c5ece8f9162c005fc04acd5c8.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-built character editors allow you to customize your player character endlessly. Change the look of your character by deleting, adding and painting blocks with easy-to- use controls. Push your changes directly into all the Single Player levels and share your custom levels with the click of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                  <strong>NPC Editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/c5e06fb52906cabada54202500b773a8.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/c5e06fb52906cabada54202500b773a8.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/c5e06fb52906cabada54202500b773a8.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the look and behaviour of all the NPC enemies by adding, deleting and painting blocks. Swap them into the Level Editor immediately to see how they behave in-game and in your user created levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/892bf6f493a68f4f3776783acc39349e.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/d583dcae206664e75f3588f44420b268.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/794d570ee9876962a817530eebf08eee.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/794d570ee9876962a817530eebf08eee.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/794d570ee9876962a817530eebf08eee.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 2 Player mode with Controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/892bf6f493a68f4f3776783acc39349e.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/22dc84e4f0340b347ee78c7a7e28ba09.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using <strong>Steam Deck</strong>\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/892bf6f493a68f4f3776783acc39349e.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/e0dcfd4792f7f190f45c6d8479c811a0.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ffd88b88ba68a0f30b226fbdc96785a8.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ffd88b88ba68a0f30b226fbdc96785a8.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ffd88b88ba68a0f30b226fbdc96785a8.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using DualSense\u2122 Wireless Controller, Xbox Wireless Controller &amp; Mouse and Keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/892bf6f493a68f4f3776783acc39349e.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/1440441a56e6779cc9a425c027a2579e.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=30 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/a8ecde55d59eb53d269119b520e98121.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/a8ecde55d59eb53d269119b520e98121.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko and his brother Lokko Sr. run a small pizza shop called Lokko Pizza. They make the best pizzas in the world, and they hand deliver them smoking hot anywhere in the world.\u00a0Deliver pizzas all over the world to your hungry customers whether it\u2019s a sweet Hawaiian Surprise or a cheesy Sicilian Special.\u00a0However, in another part of town, the evil fast-food corporation lead by Goobol and his minions, try their best to stop Lokko from delivering pizza. Goobol is all about making\u00a0fast cheap terrible food.\u00a0By stopping Lokko, the world will have no choice but to eat their frozen processed food. Lokko will run, drive or teleport through space and time to get you a fresh wholesome pizza. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1810630?t=1768540104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768540104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/d525b43059b318f8dffdb6c8e82b2ae2598f6542/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768540104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/d525b43059b318f8dffdb6c8e82b2ae2598f6542/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768540104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37}