fun, unique and creative level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/892bf6f493a68f4f3776783acc39349e.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2ab7ce2c3f8f08da30fb1d2745d1fa05.webp?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/75d6b84a41b53e76589dccef8e535824.poster.avif?t=1768540104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/75d6b84a41b53e76589dccef8e535824.webm?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/75d6b84a41b53e76589dccef8e535824.mp4?t=1768540104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our In-built level editor for platforming, players have the ability to generate and distribute their own levels. Hook up advanced level designs by chaining timers, accelerators and switches, placing NPCs and Bosses to make fun playable levels with your friends. Easy to use and intuitive controls with game controllers and keyboard/ mouse support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                              <strong>Character Editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/8e16